            "jcr:created": "Wed Jan 11 2023 19:20:33 GMT+0000",
            "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Social media is a great way to develop an online presence and communicate directly with your existing patients and attract new patients. <b>To learn more and request a copy of our Patient Marketing Toolkit, contact us at&nbsp;<a href=\"patientmarketingfa@stryker.com\" target=\"_blank\">patientmarketingfa@stryker.com</a>.</b></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Follow Stryker's Foot &amp; Ankle team on Social Media!</span></span></p>\n",
